# Pins for tests/kind/run.sh (P7-DEPL-05). Every download is verified against the
# sha256 below before it runs; bump a version and its four sums together.
# (Kept here, inside tests/kind/, because the Ticket's write scope is this directory.
#  KUBERNETES_VERSION and the helm image used by tests/template-check.sh stay in
#  ../tools.env.)

# nself-org/cli commit the workflow builds when its cli_ref input is empty. Never `main`.
